      "height": 140,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2. Document Root Attribute\nSets `data-theme=\"dark\"` on `<html>` root before DOM rendering (Zero FOUC)."
    },
    {
      "id": "header_n3",
      "x": 800,
